The AMQP topic routing key scheme it publishes with (KK.EVENT.CLIENT.* and KK.EVENT.ADMIN.*) follows
the convention established by keycloak-event-listener-rabbitmq
(https://github.com/aznamier/keycloak-event-listener-rabbitmq), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Keeping the same scheme is deliberate, so a consumer already bound to those keys works
unchanged.

